mitted in cassettes   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   4 agg  all   Specimen C labeled  right breast  consists of a mastectomy specimen with a  nipple  areola and a triangular shaped portion of skin with a single stitch at  the 12 o clock edge  The specimen weighs 874 grams and measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x  5 5cm  The segment of skin that contains the nipple and areola is REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  cm  and has a punctate linear scar in the inferior portion of the skin  There  is a palpable nodule underneath the segment of skin  The superior half of the  breast is inked blue  the inferior  green  the deep margin  black  It is  serially sectioned and shows a firm  stellate area in the inferior portion of  the specimen  This area grossly measures up to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm  and focally  extends towards the inferior margin and is near the segment of skin  It is  about 1cm  from the deep margin  No other suspicious areas are seen  No  lymph nodes are identified  10 agg  Sections are submitted as follows   Section code   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    segment of nipple and areola   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    section of skin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    random section of upper outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    random section of lower outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    random section of upper inner quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    random section of lower inner quadrant near stellate area   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    sections of tumor   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  is tumor closest to inferior margin    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  is tumor closest to deep margin    Dictated by  NAM____ signature on file ____DENNIS J  FEEN  M D  REMOVED_DATE  Final   ____ signature on file ____NICOLE MIHOK  M D  REMOVED_DATE  Final    report_end  , No.
