Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  Final Type  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  ACCESSIONED ON  21 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 15 11 CLINICAL DATA   None Provided                                                                                      FINAL DIAGNOSIS     BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY  INVASIVE DUCTAL CARCINOMA  GRADE 2  DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU CONFINED TO THE MASS  SEE NOTE  NOTE  Blood vessel and lymphatic vessel invasion is not seen  The margins of the specimen cannot be evaluated  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLA   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY IN 12 OF 12 LYMPH NODES  Diagnosis by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  23 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 14 47                                                                                     RECEPTOR IMMUNOHISTOCHEMISTRY Addendum     RESULTS OF STAINING OF FIXED TISSUE FOR HORMONE RECEPTOR PROTEINS BREAST  RIGHT   The tumor cells stain for estrogen receptor protein  The tumor cells stain for progesterone receptor protein  See note  Note  In this laboratory  we used this antibody to stain 100 breast carcinomas prepared in the usual way  paraffin sections  and we compared the results with determinations of estrogen receptor by biochemical assay  91  of tumors that stained with this antibody were positive for estrogen receptors by biochemical assay  96  of tumors that failed to stain with this antibody were negative for estrogen receptors by biochemical assay  When we compared the results of staining of paraffin sections with the results of staining of frozen sections  the predictive value of a positive result was 97  and the predictive value of a negative result was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  27 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 17 20                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTSIDE LOCATION REPORTS TO  Irene Kuter  M D  OUTSIDE INSTITUTION  BAPTIST HOSPITAL EAST OUTSIDE PATHOLOGIST  Mark E  Richardson  M D  OUTSIDE CLINICIAN  M  Richardson M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Date of Procedure  27 JUN  REMOVED_CASE_ID  Slides  8 Blocks  1  report_end  , No.
